  "title": "Qt+CMake: Fix build without Qt Multimedia",
  "description": "Commit d8964fac30c359a109fcb78242b8eb8ead79d37e added use of\nQNetworkAccessManager and other classes from Qt Network. The\nincludes and link libraries seem to get pulled in as transitive\ndependencies if Qt Multimedia is found and linked, but not\nnecessarily otherwise.\n\nQt Multimedia is optional, but Qt Network is part of Qt Base and\nshould always be found.\n\nShould fix the GitHub Windows build that doesn't install Qt Multimedia:\nhttps://github.com/wireshark/wireshark/actions/runs/24245706056\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
